  {
   "key": "func ArchiveStore.discardTrashed(_:)",
   "hash": "5d4a79facdcf71f0",
   "does": "Under archiveLock throughout (so a write of the session between the index check and a removal cannot lose its file). For a session the index lists, removes only its Trash file and returns whether that worked. Otherwise removes the <id>.json a failed delete left in the archive folder (removeLeftover: only for a tombstoned id with a complete index) and then the Trash file, the leftover first so a failure leaves the Trash file and the Trash listing in place. When both are gone and it had a Trash file or the id is tombstoned, and the session has no quarantined copy (parkedCopies empty, not nil), clears its session entry from PendingEncryptionLedger. Returns true when neither file is left, false when a removal failed (logged) or the leftover was kept.",
   "entry": null,
   "calls": [
    "ext:NSLock",
    "Emuqu/Sources/Storage/Archive+Trash.swift::func ArchiveStore.trashURL(for:)",
    "Emuqu/Sources/Storage/Archive+Internal.swift::func ArchiveStore.entryById(_:)",
    "Emuqu/Sources/Storage/Archive+Trash.swift::func ArchiveStore.removeQuietly(_:id:)",
    "Emuqu/Sources/Storage/Archive+Trash.swift::func ArchiveStore.removeLeftover(of:tombstoned:)",
    "Emuqu/Sources/Storage/Archive+Trash.swift::func ArchiveStore.parkedCopies(of:)",
    "Emuqu/Sources/Storage/PendingEncryptionLedger.swift::func PendingEncryptionLedger.clear(_:)"
   ],
   "reads": [
    "mem:SessionArchive.deletedSessionIds"
   ],
   "writes": [],
   "branches": [
    {
     "at": "+5",
     "cond": "the session is in the index",
     "effect": "remove only its Trash file; return whether that worked"
    },
    {
     "at": "+8",
     "cond": "a leftover was kept, or a removal failed",
     "effect": "return false; Trash file (if the leftover stopped it) and ledger untouched"
    },
    {
     "at": "+9",
     "cond": "removed a Trash file or tombstoned, and no quarantined copy",
     "effect": "clear the ledger entry; return true"
    }
   ],
